{"data":[{"slug":"co-founderin-business-development-b2b-marketing-hospitality-darmstadt-104013","company_name":"Modumat","title":"Co-Founder*in: Business Development, B2B-Marketing & Hospitality (w/m/d)","description":"<h3>Über uns: Wer ist Modumat und was treibt uns an?</h3><p>Wir sind <strong>Modumat</strong> – und wir gestalten die Zukunft der smarten, nachhaltigen Warenausgabe!</p><p>Klassische Verkaufsautomaten sind oft klobig, unflexibel, wartungsintensiv und verbrauchen unnötig viele Ressourcen. Mit unserem modularen Hardware- und Softwareansatz denken wir das Prinzip neu: Wir machen automatisierte Versorgung flexibel anpassbar, datengestützt und ressourcenschonend. Damit schaffen wir echten Mehrwert im Alltag – von der smarten Snack-Station bis zur einladenden, vollautomatisierten 24/7-Micro-Lobby in Hotels.</p><p>Hinter Modumat stehen wir: <strong>Raphael und Frederik</strong>, zwei Informatik-Masterstudenten an der Hochschule Darmstadt (h_da). Unser erster Prototyp läuft bereits erfolgreich im Live-Betrieb bei einem Pilotkunden, und unsere Vision wurde jüngst mit der <strong>Dörte-Wörner-Innovationsförderung</strong> ausgezeichnet. Da wir im Frühjahr unseren Master abschließen, gehen wir nun gemeinsam den nächsten Schritt: Wir beantragen das <strong>EXIST-Gründerstipendium</strong>, um Modumat als nachhaltig wachsendes Vollzeit-Startup (GmbH) aufzubauen.</p><p>Unsere Technologie steht auf einem stabilen Fundament. <strong>Jetzt fehlst du uns als 3. Kernteammitglied – die strategische, kommunikative und wirtschaftliche Perspektive für unser Gründungsteam!</strong></p><h3>Was du bei Modumat bewegst</h3><p>Als kaufmännische und kommunikative Säule unseres Teams verbindest du unsere Technologie mit den Menschen und Märkten, die sie brauchen:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Markenaufbau & B2B-Kommunikation:</strong> Du entwickelst unsere Positionierungsstrategie, verleihst Modumat eine starke Stimme und machst unsere Lösung bei relevanten B2B-Zielgruppen sichtbar (über LinkedIn, Branchen-Events, gezieltes Storytelling und Kampagnen).</p></li><li><p><strong>Fokus Hospitality & Gästeerlebnis:</strong> Du tauchst tief in die Welt der Hotellerie ein (z. B. moderne 24/7-Lobby-Konzepte, smarter Minibar-Ersatz, Entlastung des Hotelpersonals) und gestaltest gemeinsam mit Entscheidungsträger*innen der Branche Lösungen, die Gäste und Hotelteams gleichermaßen begeistern.</p></li><li><p><strong>Partnerschaften & Kundenbeziehungen:</strong> Du baust nachhaltige Beziehungen zu B2B-Partnern auf (Hotels, Coworking-Spaces, moderne Gastgeber) und gewinnst gemeinsam mit uns erste Pilotpartner sowie <em>Letters of Intent (LOIs)</em> für den EXIST-Antrag.</p></li><li><p><strong>Geschäftsmodell & EXIST-Antrag:</strong> Du übernimmst die Verantwortung für den wirtschaftlichen Teil unserer Gründungsreise – von der Markt- und Zielgruppenanalyse über faire Pricing-Modelle bis hin zur Finanzplanung im Rahmen des EXIST-Stipendiums.</p></li><li><p><strong>Webpräsenz & Außenwirkung:</strong> Du gestaltest unseren Auftritt (Website, Pitch Decks, Kommunikationsmaterial) so, dass aus innovativer Technik verständliche, einladende Mehrwerte für unsere Kund*innen werden.</p></li></ul><h3>Was du mitbringst</h3><p><em>(Hinweis: Du musst noch nicht in jedem einzelnen Punkt jahrelange Erfahrung haben – viel wichtiger ist uns deine Begeisterung, dich in neue Themen einzuarbeiten und gemeinsam mit uns zu wachsen!)</em></p><ul><li><p><strong>Studienhintergrund:</strong> Du studierst BWL, Marketing, Hospitality-/Tourismus-Management, International Business, Kommunikationsmanagement, Wirtschaftsingenieurwesen oder ein verwandtes Fach (kurz vor dem Masterabschluss oder bereits abgeschlossen).</p></li><li><p><strong>Gespür für Hospitality & Service (großes Plus):</strong> Du kennst die Dynamik der Hotellerie oder Gastronomie (z. B. Personalmangel, Gästebedürfnisse, 24/7-Service) aus Praktika, Werkstudententätigkeiten oder deinem Netzwerk – oder du hast große Lust, diese spannende Branche mit sinnstiftender Technologie zu unterstützen.</p></li><li><p><strong>Kommunikationsstärke & Kundenfokus:</strong> Du hörst Kund*innen genau zu, verstehst ihre Herausforderungen und kannst komplexe Produkte empathisch, klar und überzeugend vermitteln.</p></li><li><p><strong>Offenheit für Tech & moderne KI-Tools:</strong> Du musst keine Zeile Code schreiben. Wichtig ist, dass du neugierig auf digitale Innovationen bist und moderne KI-Tools (wie ChatGPT, Canva/Design-Tools oder Recherche-Tools) gerne nutzt, um dir den Arbeitsalltag kreativ und effizient zu erleichtern.</p></li><li><p><strong>Gestaltungswille & Teamgeist:</strong> Du arbeitest gerne strukturiert und eigenverantwortlich, schätzt aber genauso den engen Austausch im Team, um gemeinsam Ideen weiterzuentwickeln.</p></li></ul><h3>Was dich bei uns erwartet</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Gründen auf echter Augenhöhe:</strong> Du kommst nicht als Angestellte*r dazu, sondern als vollwertige Co-Founderin bzw. vollwertiger Co-Founder. Wir treffen Entscheidungen gemeinsam und legen großen Wert auf eine offene, wertschätzende und transparente Teamkultur.</p></li><li><p><strong>Finanzielle Sicherheit & faire Anteile:</strong> Über das EXIST-Gründerstipendium erhältst du nach Bewilligung bis zu <strong>2.500 €/Monat</strong>, um dich ohne finanziellen Druck auf das Startup zu konzentrieren. Zudem erhältst du eine faire, transparente Beteiligung (Equity) an der gemeinsamen GmbH.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexibilität & Work-Life-Balance:</strong> Ob in unserem schönen, ausgestatteten Projektraum an der h_da (Gebäude D22) oder flexibel im Homeoffice – wir richten unsere Arbeitsweise so ein, dass sie zu unserem Leben passt.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ein verlässliches Fundament:</strong> Du startest nicht bei null. Technik, Prototyp und erste Förderungen sind bereits da – und wir (Raphael & Frederik) stehen dir als verlässliche, hilfsbereite Partner bei allen technischen Fragen jederzeit den Rücken frei.</p></li><li><p><strong>Starkes Netzwerk & Mentoring:</strong> Rundum-Support durch YUBIZZ!, das Startup-Zentrum der Hochschule Darmstadt (Workshops, Gründungsförderung & Ökosystem), sowie individuelles Mentoring und Sparring durch unseren Gründercoach Prof. Dr. Michael von Rüden.</p></li></ul><h3>Hast du Lust, Modumat gemeinsam mit uns groß zu machen?</h3><p>Wenn du dich in vielen Punkten wiederfindest – auch wenn vielleicht nicht jeder einzelne Haken zu 100 % sitzt –, freuen wir uns riesig, von dir zu hören!</p><p>Schreib uns einfach eine kurze, unkomplizierte Nachricht mit deinem LinkedIn-Profil oder Lebenslauf. Lass uns gerne ganz entspannt bei einem Kaffee oder Tee an der Hochschule Darmstadt oder via Video-Call kennenlernen und schauen, ob die Chemie stimmt!</p><p></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/modumat/co-founderin-business-development-b2b-marketing-hospitality-darmstadt-104013","tags":["Directors","Chief Executives"],"job_types":["Freiberufler / selbstständiger","freelance","geschäftsleitung"],"location":"Darmstadt","created_at":1792324861},{"slug":"senior-engineering-manager-grafana-frontend-germany-remote-95882","company_name":"grafanalabs","title":"Senior Engineering Manager, Grafana Frontend | Germany | Remote","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineering Manager, Grafana Frontend&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana is an open-source observability product and a platform that teams and plugin developers build on. The Frontend group shapes its user experience (from dashboards and visualisation to navigation, search and sharing) and the foundations that support engineering teams and community contributors across the Grafana ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Engineering Manager, you’ll lead the Frontend Platform and Navigation squads, owning their performance, delivery and customer outcomes. Frontend Platform enables teams to build reliable, high-quality experiences; Navigation helps users find and organise resources and move confidently through Grafana.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll develop senior engineers, partner with Product and Design, and improve how teams work, including through AI and automation. We use Cloud-first rollout and experimentation to learn quickly, bringing relevant improvements to OSS and Enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI Notice: We invest heavily in developer productivity. You can use modern AI coding assistants as part of your daily workflow (your choice of tools, within security guidelines), backed by a company-funded usage budget so you can iterate quickly without unnecessary friction. We encourage pragmatic AI-assisted development: faster prototyping, test generation, refactors, documentation, and incident follow-ups—always with strong code review and quality standards. You&#39;ll also have access to the latest frontier models from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for the performance of &lt;strong&gt;two&lt;/strong&gt; distributed engineering squads: set clear expectations, delegate effectively, coach and develop each team member, give timely feedback, address performance gaps and build a culture of trust and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own hiring and team planning across both squads, aligning team capacity and skills with product priorities and longer-term needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery with your squads: engage directly with customers, community members and internal users, combine their feedback with research and usage evidence, and use those insights to shape roadmaps and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design and engineering leaders to set priorities, resolve dependencies and make trade-offs between customer needs, long-term investments and operational demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery across both squads from discovery through rollout and measurement: set milestones, surface risks early and intervene when commitments are at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI regularly in your management work to synthesise research and feedback, inform roadmap and resourcing decisions, and streamline coordination, reporting and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve how the squads plan, make decisions and deliver. Lead the adoption of AI and automation across engineering and operational workflows, evaluating their impact on delivery speed, quality and time spent on repetitive work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set engineering direction with senior engineers for the frontend foundations owned by your squads, including developer experience, accessibility, architecture, tooling, reliability and multitenant capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set engineering direction for navigation, search and resource organisation, including where AI-assisted discovery can help users find what they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and uphold engineering standards for quality, security and operability, including how teams evaluate and validate AI-assisted work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead improvements across Grafana and R&amp;amp;D that increase engineering productivity and improve business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the engineering management on-call rota, coordinate responses and drive improvements that reduce recurring disruption. Regularly use Grafana’s AI capabilities for observability, incident investigation and management, bringing that experience into product feedback and roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience managing senior engineers, building healthy teams and developing technical leaders. You give clear feedback and address performance gaps directly and fairly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical foundation in modern web or frontend systems, enabling you to evaluate technical trade-offs and shape architectural and engineering-quality decisions with senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of turning ambiguous, cross-team problems into clear priorities and measurable results, managing delivery risks and operational demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product and customer judgement, with the ability to connect engineering investments to user, developer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise written communication and the ability to work effectively in a remote, globally distributed organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appreciation for open-source development and the judgement to balance Cloud-first delivery with the needs of customers, community members and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI and automation in your own leadership work, and leading teams to adopt them effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with React, TypeScript or comparable large-scale frontend ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a developer platform team, including support for plugins or extensions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with navigation, search, information architecture or resource-management products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering multitenant SaaS or major platform migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on a widely adopted open-source product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Germany, the Base compensation range for this role is EUR &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;124,571&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;- EUR &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;149,485&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed in the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/grafanalabs/senior-engineering-manager-grafana-frontend-germany-remote-95882","tags":["R&D: Grafana"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792324535},{"slug":"remote-staff-solutions-architect-ai-subject-matter-expert-456239","company_name":"gitlab","title":"Staff Solutions Architect, AI Subject Matter Expert","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Subject Matter Expert (SME), you&#39;ll be the deepest technical voice in the field for one product group, helping customers make technical decisions on GitLab&#39;s most important opportunities, roughly the top 10% by size or complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Solutions Architects (Account SAs) will bring you into prioritized opportunities. The Account SA owns the opportunity; you own your product group&#39;s success within it. You&#39;ll work directly with Product and Engineering, bringing customer needs and field insights into roadmap discussions. You&#39;ll also help the wider Solutions Architecture team build expertise through reusable assets, enablement, and coaching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll specialize in one product group, not all four. In Security &amp;amp; Compliance, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Ultimate, application security, Dependency Firewall, software supply chain security, compliance, and artificial intelligence (AI) governance. In Platform, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Dedicated, self-managed deployments, bring your own model, and cloud and hybrid architecture. In Core DevSecOps, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Premium, continuous integration and continuous delivery (CI/CD), source code management, Orbit, Artifact Central, and migrations. DevSecOps brings development, security, and operations together across software delivery. In AI &amp;amp; Competitive, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Duo Agent Platform, agentic workflows, AI-native development, competitive displacement including GitHub, and migrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your success will be measured by technical win rate and bookings on SME-engaged opportunities, product-category commit attainment and consumption growth in your region, and Proof of Value (PoV) conversion rate, evaluation cycle time, and time from technical win to production use. We&#39;ll also measure how often Account SAs reuse your assets, their confidence in handling your product group without escalation, and the quality and impact of your feedback to Product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical authority for your product group on prioritized opportunities, from discovery and architecture through trials and PoV evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical deep dives, workshops, and executive briefings that connect product capabilities to business outcomes and explain how GitLab differs from competing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve standardized PoV templates with clear, repeatable success criteria. Account SAs own the customer PoV; you&#39;ll contribute product-specific content and expertise while keeping the evaluation connected to the broader GitLab platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip account teams for product launches with Product Management and Product Marketing. Build demos and talk tracks, and turn early customer wins into reference stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the escalation point for Account SAs and Post-Sales Solutions Architects (Post-Sales SAs) on complex product questions, integrations, and objections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand off PoV success criteria and architecture decisions to the Post-Sales SA with the account team when an opportunity closes. Stay involved until the customer&#39;s first production workload uses the product, and support complex accounts when Post-Sales SAs bring you in to drive adoption and consumption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structured field feedback, competitive insights, and customer requirements to Product Management and Engineering with the wider SME team. Help manage early-access and design-partner programs, and represent GitLab through customer events, conferences, industry working groups, and published content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reference architectures, demo environments, competitive battlecards, PoV playbooks, and enablement content so account teams can handle more opportunities without your direct involvement. Mentor Account SAs and contribute to GitLab&#39;s global SME community of practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience in technical pre-sales, solutions architecture, consulting, or software engineering, with deep, hands-on expertise in one domain: application security testing, supply chain security, and compliance; scalable cloud and hybrid platforms; large CI/CD environments and source code migrations; or production AI-assisted development, working prototypes, and competitive evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical expertise in agentic and AI-assisted development workflows across planning, coding, testing, security, and delivery, applied in a customer-facing, pre-sales context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience winning technical decisions on large, complex enterprise opportunities through structured Proof of Concept (PoC) or PoV evaluations with defined success criteria and executive sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Git, CI/CD, containers, Kubernetes, and at least one major cloud provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to lead a whiteboard session with engineers and present the business case to executives in the same meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication, including the ability to turn complex topics into clear playbooks that others use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working asynchronously across time zones with Sales, Product, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional: public speaking, published technical content, open source contributions, or relevant certifications in Kubernetes, cloud architecture, or security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you bring transferable experience in an adjacent domain, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building our SME organization within GitLab&#39;s Solutions Architecture team, and we&#39;re distributed and all-remote.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/gitlab/remote-staff-solutions-architect-ai-subject-matter-expert-456239","tags":["SA"],"job_types":[],"location":"Remote","created_at":1792324527},{"slug":"director-european-government-operations-munich-347652","company_name":"rocketlab","title":"Director, European Government Operations","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT ROCKET LAB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rocket Lab is the end-to-end space company building rockets, spacecraft, and critical subsystems that keep the world connected, protected, expand humanity’s reach to the Moon, Mars, and beyond. We move fast, build real hardware for meaningful missions, and make the impossible routine. Come shape the future with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIRECTOR – EUROPEAN GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director – European Government Operations, based in &lt;strong&gt;Munich/ Berlin, &lt;/strong&gt;Germany, you will lead Rocket Lab’s government affairs strategy across Germany and the broader European region. You will play a critical role in advancing Rocket Lab’s business objectives by shaping policy environments, building strategic government relationships, and ensuring alignment between Government Affairs and Business Development. In this role, you will work at the intersection of aerospace innovation, national security, and European public-sector engagement. To be successful, you must be results‑oriented, proactive, politically astute, and deeply comfortable operating in complex, fast‑moving environments. Join a driven team of pioneers relentlessly tackling challenging projects, delivering on the impossible, and making an impact on the future of space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET TO DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead Rocket Lab’s in‑house European Government Operations function, delivering the same level of strategic support and government engagement the company receives in the U.S. market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and lead Rocket Lab’s government affairs strategy in Germany and across Europe, ensuring alignment with corporate priorities and business development objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain high‑impact relationships with key German federal stakeholders, including the Bundestag, DLR, Ministry of Defense, and relevant regulatory and executive agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and grow Rocket Lab’s presence with government entities and innovation ecosystems in Munich and other strategic European hubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Business Development team to support market expansion, customer engagement, and pursuit of government‑funded programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and influence policy discussions related to space, defense, launch, and emerging technologies, ensuring Rocket Lab’s interests are represented and understood&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic guidance on political, regulatory, and industrial‑policy developments across Europe, identifying opportunities and risks for business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Rocket Lab in industry associations, working groups, and public‑sector forums to strengthen the company’s visibility and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable business outcomes through targeted government engagement not only monitoring policy trends but actively shaping them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to senior leadership on European political dynamics, defense priorities, and government procurement pathways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU’LL BRING THESE QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in political science, international relations, public policy, law, economics, engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in government affairs, public policy, defense, aerospace, or related strategic roles within Germany or Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building and managing relationships with senior government officials, policymakers, and public‑sector institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive business‑aligned outcomes through government engagement, not solely policy monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of European political structures, defense priorities, and government procurement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate autonomously, set strategy, and execute in a fast‑paced, high‑growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, negotiation, and stakeholder‑management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THESE QUALIFICATIONS WOULD BE NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in space, aerospace, defense, or dual‑use technology sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or within institutions such as DLR, MOD, Bundestag committees, EU defense bodies, or national innovation agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior roles in business development, defense industrial policy, or public‑sector consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Munich’s government, defense, or technology ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with NATO, EU defense initiatives, and cross‑border industrial‑cooperation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;This position may require prolonged periods of sitting, standing, walking, computer work, and occasional exposure to moderate levels of noise, dust, and fumes in production areas&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to unlock the potential of space to improve life on Earth, but that’s not an easy task. It takes hard work, determination, relentless innovation, teamwork, grit, and an unwavering commitment to achieving what others often deem impossible. Our people out-think, out-work, and out-pace. We pride ourselves on having each other’s backs, checking our egos at the door, and rolling up our sleeves on all tasks big and small. We thrive under pressure, work to tight deadlines, and our focus is always on how we can deliver, rather than dwelling on the challenges that stand in the way.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Important information:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CANDIDATES SEEKING TO WORK IN US OFFICES ONLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To conform to U.S. Government space technology export regulations, including the International Traffic in Arms Regulations (ITAR), Rocket Lab Employees must be a U.S. citizen, lawful U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State and/or the U.S. Department of Commerce, as applicable. Learn more about ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.us/v2/url?u=https-3A__www.pmddtc.state.gov_-3Fid-3Dddtc-5Fkb-5Farticle-5Fpage-26sys-5Fid-3D24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&amp;amp;d=DwMFog&amp;amp;c=N_fLK0KxmM34zjMadXHMx_SQYmXWO3FX0MRVr1hBcn4&amp;amp;r=prjnch9sxomG2ahCicblmM3m-FuPObepspoR1qvWq2I&amp;amp;m=ExC44mBPk2emo4Fr0xPSGZN0UraQ1ZtkDTxwR7iWw5rixcFQb-Wjlv7lJcecLldz&amp;amp;s=0lfm4LyRtFwK220WHBK11DGHWSVvVhQEcfa5G_2Nf18&amp;amp;e=&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Rocket Lab provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment at Rocket Lab, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applicants requiring a reasonable accommodation for the application/interview process for a job in the United States should contact Giulia Johnson at &lt;a ---------- dedicated resource is intended solely to assist job seekers with disabilities whose disability prevents them from being able to apply/interview. Only messages left for this purpose will be considered. A response to your request may take up to two business days.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CANDIDATES SEEKING TO WORK IN NEW ZEALAND OFFICES ONLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For security reasons, background checks will be undertaken prior to any employment offers being made to an applicant.&amp;nbsp; These checks will include nationality checks as it is a requirement of this position that you be eligible to access equipment and data regulated by the United States&#39; International Traffic in Arms Regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Under these Regulations, you may be ineligible for this role if you do not hold citizenship of Australia, Japan, New Zealand, Switzerland, the European Union, or a country that is part of NATO, or if you hold ineligible dual citizenship or nationality.&amp;nbsp; For more information on these Regulations, click here &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link ___m14voj0 f3rmtva f1ern45e f1deefiw f1n71otn f1q5o8ev f1h8hb77 f1vxd6vx f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f9n3di6 f1ids18y fygtlnl f1deo86v f12x56k7 f1iescvh ftqa4ok f50u1b5 fs3pq8b f1hghxdh f1tymzes f1x7u7e9 f1cmlufx f10aw75t fsle3fq&quot; href=&quot;https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2020/01/23/2020-00574/international-traffic-in-arms-regulations-us-munitions-list-categories-i-ii-and-iii&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ITAR Regulations.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/rocketlab/director-european-government-operations-munich-347652","tags":["1550 Government Operations"],"job_types":[],"location":"Munich","created_at":1792324526},{"slug":"group-digital-director-dusseldorf-north-rhine-westphalia-58118","company_name":"Gumgum","title":"Group Digital Director","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GumGum is The Mindset Company™ transforming advertising. We’re an advertising technology company delivering results by matching brands with people in the right mindset in the moments that matter. Our platform is powered by the Mindset Graph™, our AI-driven data engine that processes billions of real-time contextual, creative, environmental, and historical signals to match every ad with the most receptive audience. The result is advertising that drives meaningful outcomes for advertisers and publishers, and is more relevant for consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were founded in 2008 and are headquartered in Santa Monica, California, operating in over 19 markets across North America, Europe, Japan, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our principles guide our work every day and are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re focused on advertising solutions that solve needs and drive success for clients and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make it Happen:&lt;/strong&gt; We have a bias for action and take ownership to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Always Innovate:&lt;/strong&gt; We push boundaries with creativity and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt; We ensure colleagues feel included, supported, and empowered to thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be a part of The Mindset Company™ transforming advertising, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gumgum.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.gumgum.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Düsseldorf, the Group Digital Director, Germany is an experienced player/coach who leads a local sales team of two while remaining personally active in the market to drive revenue targets across the Düsseldorf agency ecosystem. Serving as the key regional leader, this role leverages senior holding-company relationships across major media agencies to open doors, negotiate trading deals, and secure agency development opportunities. Operating in close alignment with the Hamburg team and broader EU stakeholders, the Director establishes strategic patch goals, accurate financial forecasting, and seller development while representing GumGum at industry events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and exceed the Düsseldorf revenue target while leading and coaching a team of two sellers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a player/coach in-market, maintaining senior holding-company relationships, joining key pitches, and unblocking deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate, renew, and grow Düsseldorf agency trading deals and commercial agreements to ensure profitability and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute annual/quarterly planning, set sales strategies, manage pipeline coverage, and deliver accurate financial forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, motivate, and develop the Düsseldorf sales team through regular operating cadences and performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Hamburg sales leadership and wider EU teams to drive national agency development and product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent GumGum at German industry events and collaborate cross-functionally with AdOps, Client Success, and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in digital media, ad tech, or advertising sales, with significant time in the German market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or near-native German fluency and professional fluency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established, trusted relationships across the Düsseldorf agency ecosystem (especially holding companies and key independents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven sales management experience, with a track record of developing sellers and leading distributed or split-location teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of programmatic buying, ad serving, and the German digital ad landscape (knowledge of attention/contextual solutions is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience negotiating agency trading deals and holding firm on commercial terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and proficiency with PowerPoint, Excel, and CRM tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn about our benefits &amp;amp; perks package at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gumgum.com/benefits&quot;&gt;gumgum.com/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. If you&#39;d like additional information, your recruiter can share more specifics during the hiring process!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Note: GumGum fosters a flexible work environment, offering GumGummers the ability to work either in-office or remotely/from home. However, for occasional in-person collaboration, we kindly ask that this position be located within a &#39;commutable&#39; distance to our office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 &amp;amp; 2026 Digiday Media Awards Europe Best Contextual Targeting Offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 AdExchanger Awards AI Innovators, Technology &amp;amp; Service Provider, Finalist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 MARKETECH APAC Marketing Technology Awards Silver Winner for Best Contextual Advertising Tech Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re always learning and evolving as a company, and we continue to take thoughtful steps to support our people and strengthen our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
