&lt;p&gt;About us&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EggAI is a fast-growing, 100% remote AI consulting and development startup based in Munich. We build agentic AI solutions for enterprise clients. We are growing in several European markets at the same time, are actively building our internal structures — and are looking for someone to help shape this growth phase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are our go-to person for day-to-day accounting. You make sure every receipt, invoice and expense ends up in the right place — cost center, account, country — and you prepare everything so that our external tax advisor can book without back-and-forth. You work across several European countries, with employees and freelancers, and with local payroll providers. We don’t have fully established processes yet, so you won’t just follow a playbook: you spot gaps, think the process through and set it up yourself. You work closely with our Head of Finance, who owns controlling, forecasting and reporting, and with our external tax advisor, who handles ongoing bookkeeping, annual financial statements and German payroll. You ideally bring your own experience from a tax advisory firm or a similar environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Preparatory bookkeeping: Pre-code receipts and prepare them for ongoing bookkeeping by our tax advisor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Receipt and invoice management: Collect receipts and incoming invoices, review them, and consistently follow up on open items&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Correct allocation: Make sure expenses are assigned to the correct cost center and the correct account in the chart of accounts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Travel expenses across Europe: Manage per diems (meal allowances), mileage allowances and comparable expense rules across countries for our teams in Europe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Employees &amp;amp; freelancers across Europe: Know the Europe-wide controlling and accounting topics that apply to employees and freelancers — or get up to speed on them quickly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● International payroll interface: Manage local payroll providers and salary payments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Cash flow: Think along on cash flow structures &amp;amp; reporting, and keep them up to date&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Process setup: Independently think through and set up finance processes and structures in an international, growing environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What you bring&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 4+ years of professional experience in finance &amp;amp; accounting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● German at a fluent professional level (C1/C2), including German accounting and tax terminology; English at least B1, as our team is diverse and English is often the working language&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Very good DATEV skills and solid understanding of the chart of accounts and correct account assignment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Flexibility with tools: you quickly find your way around other systems such as Odoo&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● You have owned finance and accounting topics end-to-end, without day-to-day guidance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● You are comfortable in gray areas and make good decisions even without complete information&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Completed commercial vocational training or a degree with a focus on finance, accounting or controlling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Understanding of how a balance sheet should be structured to be meaningful for investors — ideally through your own experience in a tax advisory firm or similar environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Exposure to controlling topics such as cost centers, forecasts or project margins&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Motivated, proactive and creative personality with a hands-on mentality — you want to shape things, not just administer them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Why EggAI?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● 100% remote work in an international, highly motivated team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Flat structures and direct access to the Head of Finance and the founders — short paths, fast decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Freedom to shape: you help build the finance infrastructure of an AI scale-up from the ground up&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Insight into one of the most dynamic growth fields in tech and into building a company across Europe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds like you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If your profile looks like a good match we&#39;ll be in touch to organise a first stage interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note, due to the high volume of candidates, we cannot offer personalized feedback to each candidate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About EggAI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic workforces are inevitable. Making them work is our mission.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;10&quot;&gt;EggAI is building the engineering methods, operating models, and reusable technology to deploy agentic workforces with the quality and control required for sustained business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Working closely with enterprise clients, we design, implement and operate agentic systems that evolve from augmenting individual tasks to autonomously executing end-to-end processes alongside people—resilient, controlled, and scalable. We begin with the client problem, select the technical approach that best serves it, and remain accountable through deployment, adoption, and operations. Each deployment strengthens the next by turning production learning into reusable capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;14&quot;&gt;We are an experienced, international team working across Europe. We set high standards, take ownership of outcomes, and value clear thinking, candid feedback, and the ability to turn ideas into tangible results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/eggai/senior-accountant-finance-operations-281386","tags":["Business Engineering / Outcome Management"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792324522},{"slug":"ai-builder-working-student-tubingen-189697","company_name":"Eggai","title":"AI Builder — Working Student","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EggAI Labs&lt;/strong&gt; · Working Student · In Person (Tübingen, Germany)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Designing lifecycle evaluation for nondeterministic domain-specific AI systems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;eggai-labs&quot; class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;6&quot;&gt;EggAI Labs&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;8&quot;&gt;We&#39;re opening the EggAI Labs in Tübingen. The Labs purpose is to test new AI capabilities, identify what works, how they&#39;d improve delivery, and then build assets to support teams and clients. EggAI&#39;s mission cannot be achieved through one-off client projects alone and the Labs is the way to adapt and scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;10&quot;&gt;As part of the first cohort, you will join a small peer group and work directly with EggAI&#39;s CAIO, a Tübingen alumnus. You will also collaborate with our engineering, product, and project leads, who will bring you insights from client problems, help you understand their context and challenge your solutions for them. Your fellow AI Builders will be deliberately chosen to span different passions and strenghts. You will have room to explore and be expected to turn that exploration into something useful. This is not a client-facing role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-problem-evalops&quot; class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;12&quot;&gt;The problem: EvalOps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How do we prove an AI system acts as expected under various conditions?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;15&quot;&gt;We will explore&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;EvalOps&lt;/strong&gt;: the methods and tools used to check whether domain-specific AI systems meet their behavioral requirements. Among the key challenges for operating AI systems are nondeterminism, ground-truth curation, evaluation metric-design, latency and costs. EvalOps need to overcome all of them in a disciplined way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;17&quot;&gt;These questions will guide the initial work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;18&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regression suites&lt;/strong&gt;: How can domain experts turn traces, code, and prompts into useful evals in a way that scales?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;19&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coverage estimation&lt;/strong&gt;: How can we quantify the gaps between an eval suite and the range of expected agent behaviors?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;: Is it possible to detect anomalous behaviour in production with a similar precision to regression evals?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eval analysis&lt;/strong&gt;: How much evidence is enough to act (e.g., deploy, debug, roll back a feature, choose a different model)? You will help refine them, test approaches, create assets, and pose new questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-role&quot; class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;24&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;26&quot;&gt;As an AI Builder, you will take an open EvalOps problem from investigation to a working prototype, ready to be tested. Whatever your focus, you will be expected to take a problem through to a useful result. Here is what that means in practice:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;27&quot;&gt;Research emerging AI and evaluation capabilities and distinguish substance from hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;28&quot;&gt;Understand the user, workflow, domain, and organisational problem around the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;29&quot;&gt;Evaluate usefulness, quality, safety, and reliability with appropriate evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;30&quot;&gt;Communicate decisions and learning clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;31&quot;&gt;Create assets that other people can understand, use, and improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;32&quot;&gt;Code and build end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;34&quot;&gt;This shared foundation leaves room for different strengths and interests. Each AI Builder will then develop greater depth in one of three pillars.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;three-pillars-different-passions&quot; class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;36&quot;&gt;Three pillars, different passions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;38&quot;&gt;
&lt;thead class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;38&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;38&quot;&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Pillar&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Driving question&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Possible EvalOps focus&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;tr class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;What should we build?&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Workflows and interfaces that help domain experts create evals, inspect traces, understand results, and make decisions.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;41&quot;&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;How should we build it?&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Dependable and scalable evaluation infrastructure, trace processing, monitoring, and governance tooling.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;42&quot;&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;How do we know it works?&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Coverage measures, sampling strategies, scoring methods, statistical tests, anomaly detection, and reasoning under uncertainty.&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;45&quot;&gt;We expect every AI Builder to develop a practical foundation across all three pillars and to pursue greater depth in the one that most strongly matches their passion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-we-value&quot; class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;45&quot;&gt;What we value&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;46&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;46&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem obsession&lt;/strong&gt;. A difficult question captures your curiosity. You keep returning to it, pursue ideas without waiting for instructions, and care deeply about finding an answer that works.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;47&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiative and follow-through&lt;/strong&gt;. You turn uncertainty into something you can investigate, test, and improve—and stay resourceful when the first approach fails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;48&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evidence of making things work&lt;/strong&gt;. Show us something you created, the decisions you made, and what you learned along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;49&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent judgment&lt;/strong&gt;. You test new capabilities yourself, distinguish evidence from enthusiasm, and change your mind when the findings warrant it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;50&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generosity in collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;. You explain your thinking, seek candid feedback, act on it, and help others make progress.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-is-required&quot; class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;53&quot;&gt;What is required&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;54&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;54&quot;&gt;You are pursuing a Master’s degree.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;55&quot;&gt;You can write code and turn an idea into working, tested software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;56&quot;&gt;You can work from Tübingen and communicate fluently in English, our company language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;58&quot;&gt;Relevant fields include Computer Science, Machine Learning, Mathematics, Physics, Bioinformatics, Computational Neuroscience, Medical Informatics, Quantitative Data Science, Cognitive Science. We also welcome candidates from other disciplines who can demonstrate strong problem-solving and practical technical ability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-you-will-gain&quot; class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;60&quot;&gt;What you will gain&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;61&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;61&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry insight&lt;/strong&gt;. Learn what works and what breaks in real enterprise AI systems, with access to problems from EggAI’s client work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;62&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meaningful ownership&lt;/strong&gt;. Take an EvalOps problem from investigation to a working, evaluated solution, with freedom to shape the approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;63&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;. Work directly with EggAI’s Chief AI Officer and sharpen your judgment through feedback from engineering, product, and project leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;64&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Room to develop&lt;/strong&gt;. Deepen your strengths, learn from peers with complementary perspectives, and use modern AI-development tools on unresolved problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;65&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A say in the Lab’s direction&lt;/strong&gt;. Help establish its working practices, propose new questions, and influence what it pursues next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;66&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/strong&gt;, including recognition for exceptional contributions, and a potential path to a full-time EggAI role after graduation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How to apply&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A short cover letter is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your CV tells us&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;what&lt;/strong&gt; you have done so far, but we&#39;re also interested in the &lt;strong&gt;why&lt;/strong&gt;. Use the letter to explain why you made those choices, what drives you, and why the AI Builder role at EggAI Labs feels like the right next step in your career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for exceptional students, and excellence takes many forms, e.g., academic results, research or ambitious projects. Whatever form yours takes, show us the appropriate evidence, be it grades, publications, something you&#39;ve built or other evidence of impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an in-person role in Tübingen. We can only consider candidates who live within commuting distance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About EggAI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic workforces are inevitable. Making them work is our mission.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;10&quot;&gt;EggAI is building the engineering methods, operating models, and reusable technology to deploy agentic workforces with the quality and control required for sustained business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Working closely with enterprise clients, we design, implement and operate agentic systems that evolve from augmenting individual tasks to autonomously executing end-to-end processes alongside people—resilient, controlled, and scalable. We begin with the client problem, select the technical approach that best serves it, and remain accountable through deployment, adoption, and operations. Each deployment strengthens the next by turning production learning into reusable capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;code-line&quot; data-line=&quot;14&quot;&gt;We are an experienced, international team working across Europe. We set high standards, take ownership of outcomes, and value clear thinking, candid feedback, and the ability to turn ideas into tangible results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/eggai/ai-builder-working-student-tubingen-189697","tags":["Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Tübingen","created_at":1792324522},{"slug":"fellowship-talent-acquisition-3-6-months-munchen-bavaria-466781","company_name":"Alaika","title":"Fellowship - Talent Acquisition (3-6 months) (m/f/x)","description":"&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are looking for Fellows starting in October 2026 for 6 months.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Advise. Invest. Build. Meet ALAIKA - a new kind of Financial Services firm - globally scaling,&amp;nbsp;headquartered in Munich.&amp;nbsp;The work is hard. The bar is high. Convince during your Fellowship and earn the opportunity to join ALAIKA full-time after graduation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stop reading if any of these describe you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You need someone to fire the starting gun&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;→&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We only hire people who can prove they are intrinsically driven and execute.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You spot the problem and walk it to your boss&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We fall in love with problems.&amp;nbsp;Own them. Solve them. Ship solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Slow is your default&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Speed compounds. Be smart and brave enough to select 80/20 in the right way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&quot;Not possible&quot; is part of your vocabulary&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;→&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;We hire people who always find a way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Still there? Then ALAIKA might be for you.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;At ALAIKA, our vision is to build the future of Financial Services with&amp;nbsp;three brands under one roof - Advisory (Strategy Consulting), Capital (Private Equity), Building (Company Builder). Right now, we are in the midst of building our trojan horse ALAIKA Advisory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The ambition: building the leading Financial-Services-specific entrepreneurial holding - Fortune 500 access, PE discipline, Silicon Valley technology-depth and thinking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Three networks that compound&amp;nbsp;and multiply.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Financial Services. Nothing else.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One focus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The intersection of business and technology - across Strategic Transformations, AI &amp;amp; Data Intelligence, and Cybersecurity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One goal.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Being the go-to partner for the world&#39;s leading Fortune 500 financial services companies - and the ones we might help build into that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Founded in October 2022 by&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/johanna-von-geyr-374b81/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Johanna von Geyr&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(build-up and led Financial Services Practice for a NASDAQ-listed strategy consultancy) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/harald-braunstein/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Harald Braunstein&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(serial entrepreneur with exits incl. IPO), we bring together deep functional domain expertise and networks in global Financial Services, with a proven track record in building, scaling, and investing in leading software product companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Curious what ALAIKA is all about? Explore&amp;nbsp;our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alaika-advisory.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pX8HFTMUueKa5bTrP3k22kR1kFjq2Ot9/view&quot;&gt;introduction deck&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the movement&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;apply now.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The role and what you will work on&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Recruiting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Own parts of the full recruiting cycle - from crafting job profiles and posting ads to supporting screening, structured interviews, and onboarding. You touch every stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Active Sourcing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Help build and run sourcing across LinkedIn and beyond. Find candidates who aren&#39;t looking. Learn what a real sourcing engine feels like from the inside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graduate Recruitment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Help open doors to top universities. Build relationships with emerging talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ALAIKA Ambassador.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You are one of the first faces candidates see. Represent our values, energy, and ambition. Make it count.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer Branding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Support ALAIKA&#39;s presence in the market - career events, university outreach, social media. Shape how the world sees us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;When you are a fit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;“Show me an athlete who did well academically. An athlete because they know what it takes to win and they have had to experience loss.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;- Kenneth C. Griffin, Founder of Citadel&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside intrinsically driven people chasing an uncapped career - people who do &quot;what it takes&quot;. You fear&amp;nbsp;&quot;being one more number stuck in middle management&quot;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Book-smart.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Strong academic foundation. Think in structures, not gut feel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Street-smart.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Read the room fast. Prioritise ruthlessly. Grasp commercial reality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People-smart.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Communicate with precision - clear, direct, persuasive.&amp;nbsp;Build trust across functions and seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Athlete performance mindset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;High aspirations. Grit. Learn faster than the environment changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entrepreneurial guts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Self-confident achiever. Act first, apologise later&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;speed is everything. Take full ownership of work normally reserved for far more senior profiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Currently studying or graduated from a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Psychology, Business Administration, HR, or a related field. Minimum 4th Bachelor semester.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant Experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You have gained initial exposure to recruitment or HR through internships, working student roles, student initiatives, or comparable experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Recruiting is selling. Prove you could sell sand in a desert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Data-driven by default. Use metrics to optimize, not just report.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Fluent in English. German and additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Why join ALAIKA&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your launchpad.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Convince during your Fellowship and earn a full-time offer after graduation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stellar Network.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Shoulder-to-shoulder with financial services executives running today’s giants and the founders + investors building tomorrow’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Munich and Barcelona. More coming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Plus: the essentials done right - EGYM Wellpass, bike leasing, a kitchen stocked with healthy food and team events worth showing up for: Oktoberfest, team dinners, and more.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you excited about finding exceptional talent, building world-class &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;teams, and playing a key role in shaping the future of Financial Services?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Upload your CV, transcripts, and references.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s see if you are the one.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;trebuchet ms&#39;, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunities for all (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;trebuchet ms&#39;, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ALAIKA is an equal-opportunity employer. We hire on merit and welcome applications from people of all genders, backgrounds, ages, and identities.&amp;nbsp;Our team spirit celebrates diversity. We want you to be your true “you” and offer everyone an open culture and safe space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/alaika/fellowship-talent-acquisition-3-6-months-munchen-bavaria-466781","tags":["Talent Acquisition"],"job_types":[],"location":"München, Bavaria","created_at":1792324522},{"slug":"fellowship-founding-management-3-6-months-munchen-bavaria-169087","company_name":"Alaika","title":"Fellowship - Founding Management (3-6 months) (f/m/d)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;trebuchet ms&#39;, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;At  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;ALAIKA,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;  we are building the future of Financial Services with a bold vision:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;to become &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;the most specialized&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;Enterprise Financial Services advisory &amp;amp; investment &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Body Text&quot;&gt;fir