&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;trebuchet ms&#39;, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ALAIKA is an equal-opportunity employer. We hire on merit and welcome applications from people of all genders, backgrounds, ages, and identities.&amp;nbsp;Our team spirit celebrates diversity. We want you to be your true “you” and offer everyone an open culture and safe space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/alaika/fellowship-consulting-financial-services-data-ai-3-6-months-munchen-bavaria-383666","tags":["Consulting"],"job_types":[],"location":"München, Bavaria","created_at":1792324522},{"slug":"senior-finance-manager-germany-hamburg-321692","company_name":"Bwessmanagementgmbh","title":"Senior Finance Manager, Germany (m/w/d)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Hamburg, Germany&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working pattern:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time, on-site&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; German BESS portfolio, across construction, operations, transactions and financial reporting&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About BW ESS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;BW ESS is a global energy storage owner-operator, moving with speed to develop, deliver and operate market-leading projects. The business is active in the UK, Australia, Italy, Germany, Spain and Sweden, with more than 540MWh of operating Battery Energy Storage Systems, approximately 12GWh under construction and a development pipeline of several gigawatts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Part of BW Group, BW ESS builds on decades of global infrastructure experience, takes a long-term view of projects and partnerships, and focuses on unlocking value throughout the energy storage asset lifecycle.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;To find out more, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://bw-ess.com/&quot;&gt;https://bw-ess.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our culture rests on a few clear foundations: talent density over team size, flexible people over fixed structures, context over control, results over processes, and transparent, clear feedback. We move fast, give people real ownership early, and expect strong judgement and accountability in return.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;BW ESS is seeking a Senior Finance Manager, Germany to take finance ownership of its German BESS portfolio across construction, operations, transactions and financial reporting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This is a broad, hands-on role combining strong financial control with commercial finance, portfolio management and transaction support. You will act as the principal finance partner to the German business, working closely with Development, Construction, Asset Management, Strategic Finance, Treasury and Tax, as well as JV partners, lenders and external advisers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Construction finance.&lt;/strong&gt; Take finance ownership of projects through the construction phase, including oversight of project budgets, expenditure, cash requirements and capital drawdowns. You will ensure project costs are properly tracked, allocated and reported, with clear visibility of performance against budget and investment case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investment and project support.&lt;/strong&gt; Support project teams and Strategic Finance with FID materials, financial analysis and other investment decision-making. You will also help track construction-stage VAT, supplier payment terms, capex classification and cash-flow timing for German SPVs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;German portfolio operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Take finance ownership of the operating German portfolio, including portfolio management, FP&amp;amp;A and management reporting. You will monitor financial and operational performance against budgets, forecasts and investment cases, providing clear analysis to management and JV partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lender and stakeholder reporting.&lt;/strong&gt; Manage lender and stakeholder reporting, including covenant monitoring, debt-service metrics, distributions and other project-finance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transactions.&lt;/strong&gt; Support project financings, refinancings, equity transactions and other strategic transactions across the German portfolio. This includes financial analysis, modelling, due diligence and transaction support, working with Strategic Finance, Treasury and external advisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial reporting and control.&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for the integrity and accuracy of financial reporting across the German portfolio, including German GAAP/HGB, German tax compliance, local statutory accounts, audits and VAT. You will oversee outsourced accounting providers and ensure high-quality monthly, quarterly and annual reporting, statutory accounts, audit and tax compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance and systems.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain appropriate financial controls, governance and reporting processes across German SPVs and joint ventures, while supporting the implementation and continuous improvement of finance systems, processes and reporting infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;10 years’ relevant finance experience, ideally in energy, renewables, infrastructure, utilities, oil and gas or another asset-intensive environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, Business Administration or a related discipline&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Professional accounting qualification such as ACA, ACCA, CIMA, CPA or a German equivalent is preferred; substantial relevant experience may be considered in place of a formal qualification&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrable experience across both statutory accounting and FP&amp;amp;A, including close, audit, budgeting, forecasting, variance analysis and management reporting&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience supporting project or portfolio economics, investment appraisal, valuations, cash-flow forecasting or financial modelling&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong knowledge of German statutory reporting, tax and regulatory requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Confidence operating across SPVs, GmbH structures, complex corporate and JV structures, and project-finance entities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience managing outsourced service providers&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Advanced Excel and financial-modelling skills&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with ERP systems, preferably including system migration or integration experience&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Professional fluency in German and English&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; Exposure to project finance, debt covenants, lender reporting, M&amp;amp;A due diligence or transaction support. Experience with data automation, BI tools, scripting or AI-enabled analytical tools is also advantageous.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This is a high-impact finance leadership role at the centre of BW ESS’s German growth. You will work across construction, operations, transactions and reporting, with direct exposure to senior stakeholders, JV partners, lenders and external advisers.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You’ll help build the finance platform behind major energy storage assets and play a key role in supporting BW ESS’s long-term growth in Germany.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;BW ESS is committed to building a high-performing, inclusive team and welcomes applications from candidates of all backgrounds.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://bw-ess.com/bw-ess-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/bwessmanagementgmbh/senior-finance-manager-germany-hamburg-321692","tags":["Finance"],"job_types":[],"location":"Hamburg","created_at":1792324522},{"slug":"senior-account-executive-freiburg-130883","company_name":"Black Forest Labs","title":"Senior Account Executive","description":"<h3><em><strong>This role can be office-based in Freiburg, Germany or remote-first, with a requirement to be in the office one full week per month.</strong></em></h3><h2><strong>About Black Forest Labs</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re the team behind Latent Diffusion, Stable Diffusion, and FLUX—foundational technologies that changed how the world creates images and video. We’re creating the generative models that power how people make images and video—tools used by millions of creators, developers, and businesses worldwide. Our FLUX models are among the most advanced in the world, and we’re just getting started.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Headquartered in Freiburg, Germany with a growing presence in San Francisco, we’re scaling fast while staying true to what makes us different: research excellence, open science, and building technology that expands human creativity.</p><h2><strong>Why This Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our models are already seeing strong inbound demand, and we’re expanding our commercial team to accelerate adoption across enterprise and strategic partners.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for someone who can translate deep technical interest into durable, long-term partnerships  especially across complex, non-standard engagements involving APIs, on-prem deployments, and custom licensing.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This role owns the end-to-end commercial journey, working closely with research, engineering, and leadership to help customers move confidently from evaluation to production.</p><h2><strong>What You’ll Work On</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the full sales cycle from discovery through close and expansion across startups, scaleups, and enterprises</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run complex, multi-stakeholder deals involving technical buyers, executives, and legal teams</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and execute sales motions across APIs, on-prem deployments, and custom licensing</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build durable customer relationships that drive retention and long-term expansion</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner closely with solutions engineering, forward-deployed engineers, product, research, and legal on bespoke deals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate customer needs and market signals into actionable feedback for product and research</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help define early commercial processes, playbooks, and qualification frameworks as we scale</p></li></ul><h2><strong>What We’re Looking For</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ve closed real, technically complex B2B deals and know how to operate without a playbook.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You bring strong judgment navigating long sales cycles, highly competitive environments with ambiguous requirements, and evolving products, and you’re comfortable working cross-functionally to get deals done the right way, not just quickly.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You'll likely have:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling technical products to tech executives, ML teams, and enterprise stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to discuss model capabilities, inference requirements, and integration tradeoffs with technical buyers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven success managing long, multi-stakeholder sales cycles and closing strategic landmark deals</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong negotiation skills across pricing, licensing, and custom commercial terms</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track record building and scaling pipelines across different deal sizes and customer types</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfort shaping process and structure in fast-moving, early-stage environments</p></li></ul><h2><strong>How We Work Together</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re a distributed team with real offices that people actually use. Depending on your role, you’ll either join us in Freiburg or SF at least 2 days a week (or one full week every other week), or work remotely with a monthly in-person week to stay connected. We’ll cover reasonable travel costs to make this possible. We think in-person time matters, and we’ve structured things to make it accessible to all. We’ll discuss what this will look like for the role during our interview process.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Everything we do is grounded in four values:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Obsessed.</strong> We are a frontier research lab. The science has to be right, the understanding deep, the product beautiful.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Low Ego.</strong> The work speaks. The best idea wins, no matter who said it. Credit is shared. Nobody is above any task.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Bold.</strong> We take the ambitious bet. We ship, we do not wait for conditions to be perfect.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Kind.</strong> 