p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW230180559 BCX8"><strong>Product Improvement:</strong> Translate valuable feedback from field operations and customer interactions into actionable recommendations for our system and hardware development teams to continuously enhance our products.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW230180559 BCX8"><strong>Battery Troubleshooting:</strong> Perform technical troubleshooting and teardown of battery packs.</p></li></ul> <br> <h4><strong><br></strong></h4><h4><strong>What you bring to the team:</strong><br></h4><ul><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Experience:</strong> Proven background in systems integration, particularly involving software, electronics, and mechanical components.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Technical Proficiency:</strong> Strong ability to read and interpret electrical schematics, PCB layouts, and mechanical drawings. You should be proficient in understanding C-code for embedded systems, familiar with 3D CAD tools, and have a solid understanding of digital communication protocols.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Problem-Solving Skills:</strong> Exceptional analytical and problem-solving abilities, with a knack for diagnosing complex issues in real-world scenarios.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Communication:</strong> Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to effectively collaborate with internal teams and external customers.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Customer Focus:</strong> A strong customer-centric approach, dedicated to providing outstanding support and building lasting relationships.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Autonomy:</strong> Ability to work autonomously, prioritize tasks effectively, and take initiative in a fast-paced, startup environment.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Adaptability:</strong> Comfortable adapting to evolving priorities and contributing across various stages of product development.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Travel:</strong> Willingness to travel occasionally for on-site customer support and field troubleshooting.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW61828034 BCX8"><strong>Hands-on Experience:</strong> Practical, hands-on experience with technical troubleshooting of components and battery packs.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#1999e3">Note: We operate in an industry where women, as well as other minority groups, are systematically under-represented. We encourage you to apply even if you dont meet all the listed qualifications; ability and impact cannot be summarised in a few bullet points.</span></strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>Your Benefits:&nbsp;</strong></h4><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW113000096 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW113000096 BCX8"><strong>Direct impact: </strong>See your contributions rapidly integrated from cutting-edge research into industrialized products, flying in the field within short development cycles.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW113000096 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW113000096 BCX8"><strong>Culture &amp; Environment: </strong>A dynamic, fast-paced, and collaborative startup environment with flat hierarchies, efficient collaboration, and a strong emphasis on continuous learning opportunities.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW113000096 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW113000096 BCX8"><strong>Work-life Balance: </strong>We offer flexible work schedules, and 30 days of paid vacation each year to support your personal and professional life.&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW113000096 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW113000096 BCX8"><strong>Lunch Benefit: </strong>We promote healthy eating and the well-being of 