on office</strong>: We are opening a new office in London, located in the area around St Pancras International.</p></li><li><p><strong>Visit our Ghent HQ approximately every six weeks to connect with your colleagues.</strong> To get you fully acquainted with your colleagues, you'll also get an in-depth onboarding at our HQ during your first two weeks.</p></li><li><p>You will report directly to Guillaume, our <strong>GTM Lead UK,</strong> who is looking forward to coaching you extensively as you build the UK market and grow your career at Peripass.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>What we offer</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Front-row seat to scale-up growth:</strong> Be part of the next growth phase of Peripass in the UK and<strong> have a direct impact on building our market presence.</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Opportunity in a growing market:</strong> Be part of a fast-scaling SaaS company revolutionising yard management in logistics, with the opportunity to make an impact in the UK.</p></li><li><p><strong>Uncapped earning potentia</strong>l: A competitive salary with a commission plan that truly rewards success. The more you close, the more you earn.</p></li><li><p>Ownership and freedom: Take charge of your pipeline and strategy. We trust you to drive results, with the flexibility to work how and where you perform best.</p></li><li><p>Backed by a <strong>strong team:</strong> From BDR and marketing to pre-sales and Customer Success, you'll have a strong team behind you, helping you create, close and grow opportunities.</p></li><li><p>A role with <strong>real impact:</strong> Help shape our UK sales approach, market strategy and way of working as the team and market continue to grow.</p></li><li><p>Awesome office in the heart of London with a dedicated team, combined with travel to clients and the option to work from home.</p></li></ul> <br> <p>What you’ll bring: </p><ul><li><p>At least <strong>five years of work experience</strong>, 