mpany established through the combination of Intralot and Bally’s International Interactive, positioning the group as a top iGaming operator and a leading global provider of lottery solutions.</p><p>Bally’s Intralot is uniquely positioned across digital online gaming markets, lottery, iLottery, and sports betting. Operating at the intersection of technology, regulation, and entertainment. We are optimally positioned to capitalize on strong global growth trends driven by digital adoption and regulatory expansion across lottery and iGaming markets.</p><p><strong>Well, what about the team?</strong></p><p>As an Engineering Lead in Matchday and as part of the Sports domain, you will be at the forefront of managing technical aspects and setting the pace, leading by example throughout your team's endeavors. You'll lead a group of engineers, providing clear guidance to help them achieve exceptional results. Your hands-on engineering experience will be an integral part of your leadership style, as you actively contribute as a team member.</p><p>You work closely with your local Product Owner to ensure successful delivery of the product backlog across the entire Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC), with a strong focus on delivering a customer experience that we can be proud of, setting a high standard for excellence.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><strong>So, what will you be doing?</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul><li><p><strong>Team Leadership:</strong> Lead the team, ensuring they achieve their goals and outcomes effectively.</p></li><li><p><strong>Hands-on Contribution:</strong> Actively participate in team delivery, ensuring you are driving the work to completion.</p></li><li><p><strong>Product Delivery:</strong> Collaborate with our Product Owner throughout the delivery lifecycle to deliver our product backlog.</p></li><li><p><strong>Software Engineering Excellence:</strong> Promote and uphold high-quality software engineering practices within your team and work with the organization t