mal;text-decoration:none;">What we’re looking for</span></p><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">We are seeking an experienced Client Partner to join our team. Your experience might be in Product or Service Ownership, Delivery Management, or Consulting with a digital agency. </span></p><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">While account management experience is useful, we are particularly looking for candidates with client-side public sector experience, particularly in navigating complex digital projects and helping clients implement the government Service Standard. You’ll have strong experience in helping clients develop and implement effective digital services and interventions.</span><br><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">We recognise that candidates may not have deep expertise in every aspect of the role, so we’re open to different backgrounds. Whether you lean more towards Delivery or Product is less important than your ability to build strong relationships, guide clients through challenges, and contribute to sales efforts.</span></p><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">In this role, progression will be about the complexity and scale of projects and clients rather than a traditional management track. </span></p><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">We’re generally a curious, creative, and caring team. If you’re passionate about helping public sector clients navigate complex challenges, improve services, and create meaningful impact, we’d love to hear from you!</span></p><br><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:13pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">You will:</span></p><ul style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;"><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Serve as the primary point of contact for a portfolio of public sector clients, ensuring their digital strategies align with their goals.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Lead combined multidisciplinary and client teams through exploration, experimentation, and implementation, drawing on relevant research, design, and technical approaches.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Provide the strategic direction to support teams in working in agile, iterative ways to achieve the best outcomes.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Work alongside a Delivery Manager, enabling you to hold the vision and strategic direction</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Act as a navigator through relevant sector standards, helping clients understand the Service Standard and what it means for their work.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Facilitate conversations and run workshops confidently, getting hands-on with collaborative and multidisciplinary work.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Help teams translate policy intent into viable digital products or services that can be operated effectively.</span></p></li><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Contribute to business development, supporting the growth of our public sector work by identifying opportunities, leading pitches, and shaping proposals.</span></p></li></ul><br><p style="line-height:2.016;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:15pt;"><span style="font-size:13pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Core responsibilities</span></p><ul style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;"><li style="list-style-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;"><p style="line-height:1.68;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Client Relationship Management: </span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Lato, sans-serif;color:#484848;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;">Build and maintain strong strategic relationships with senior public sector stakeholders, acting as a trusted advisor across projects</span></p></li><li styl