&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/mirakllabs/senior-ai-engineer-freelance-paris-375309","tags":["Tech"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792270516},{"slug":"pre-sales-sales-engineer-paris-france-310728","company_name":"Alan","title":"Pre-Sales / Sales Engineer","description":"<h2><strong>Health can’t wait</strong>. </h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Not for symptoms to get worse. Not for a six‑month appointment. Not for a system to catch up. But that’s exactly how healthcare works today. You wait, until you can’t.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Alan exists to end the wait.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Health is a universal right, and we believe this right can only become real when it’s coupled with prevention. We need to stop treating health as something we repair and start treating it as something we build, every day. It’s not solely a question of willpower. It’s the healthcare system itself that needs to work for everyone, in a sustainable way.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">So we are building the<strong> new standard in prevention insurance. </strong>Alan is the first company that integrates insurance, prevention, and care into a single, acclaimed user experience.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are on an incredible journey to build a <strong>global leading company, with a </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers"><strong><u>unique culture</u></strong></a>. We already partner with 40K+ companies of all sizes, serving more than 1M+ members, and have reached €800M+ in ARR.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prevention as the new norm. That's what we're building with our team of 1000+ people. If it speaks to you: we're hiring across France, Spain, Belgium, and Canada. And beyond.</p><h1><strong>⭐️ The Pre-Sales role ⭐️</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our Pre-Sales team strengthens Alan’s Enterprise and Public sector Sales to better handle the specificities of our largest customers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Here are the main missions of the team you will join:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Master our platform and support Sales team by enabling them with insights, expertise and the relevant tools;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Listen and understand prospects’ needs and work internally on how Alan can address them best;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build a thorough understanding of the prospect and assess the level of functional alignment with our offering and capabilities;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Participate to RFP submissions and build Alan’s response in collaboration with Sales, Insurance and Product experts;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join the customer acquisition journey to evangelize our services and products;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as voice of the customer feeding Alan’s platform roadmap;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare handover for delightful customers’ onboardings;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Eventually coordinate the most complex customer onboardings leveraging your unique knowledge of the customer’s requirements and specificities.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will actively participate in developing this growing function within Alan and edit the company to make our Sales teams the most successful of all!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Given the growing need for onsite customer engagement, <strong>this role requires you to be based in Paris or the Île-de-France region</strong> (or within a 2-hour door to door distance with the flexibility to travel to Paris on short notice for customer meetings).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For this opportunity, we are aiming to hire within the D-E<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers/a/salary-equity"> <u>level range</u></a>.<br /></p><h1><strong>⭐️ You will be a great fit if ⭐️</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have <strong>6+ years </strong>of experience working in a SaaS environment, including <strong>at least 3</strong> in a <strong>Pre-Sales / Sales Engineering / Solution Consultant</strong> role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have a talent for quickly getting to the root cause of customers concern through active listening and requirements elicitation;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are <strong>assertive</strong> and know how to handle objections in a complex environment;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You master the art of <strong>pitching</strong> a product with transparency and without overselling its capabilities ;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have the ability to break down <strong>complex issues</strong> and identify product gaps to define the best product solutions;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You thrive at <strong>high level stakeholders’ management;</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You excel at prioritizing tasks while living up to commitments;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You love <strong>teamwork</strong> and are always eager to learn and grow;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are fluent in<strong> both French and English;</strong></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>It would be even better if you have:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with end-to-end <strong>procurement projects</strong> (buyer or supplier side) with involvement in RFI’s, RFQ’s and RFP’s;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in the <strong>French Public Sector</strong>;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in <strong>HRIS ecosystems and Payroll solutions</strong>;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in<strong> Insurance or Health platforms</strong>.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>🙌   </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/about/life-at-alan/a/perks"><strong>Perks &amp; Benefits</strong></a></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Alan, we believe that <strong>being in good health is a basic need</strong>, and it starts with our employees. This is why Alaners are provided with a stimulating environment and perks ensuring they are <strong>happy, efficient and spend only high-quality time</strong> with co-workers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Therefore, we offer:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fair rewards</strong>. Generous equity packages complement your base salary, <em>for permanent contracts only.</em></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Flexible Office</strong>. Amazing office space at our HQ, sponsored co-working hubs or a full-remote experience with home office equipment sponsorship, we want you to live where you’re the happiest.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>All the tools you need</strong>. Top of the range equipment: Macbook Pro, keyboard, laptop stand, monitor, and Bose noise-canceling headphones.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Flexible vacation policy and flexible working hours</strong>. Organize your time as you wish.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Delightful healthcare insurance:</strong> Extremely comprehensive health insurance - 100% for you and your children, 90-100% for partners depending on your country<em> (permanent contracts only)</em>.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Transport</strong>. Country-specific commuter benefits.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Learning &amp; Training opportunities</strong>. A highly flexible Training policy free books and budget to attend and speak at conferences if the opportunity arises.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Personal growth through coaching</strong>: At Alan, coaching isn't just a perk -<strong> </strong>it's core to who we are. Every Alaner is paired with a dedicated coach from day one, who helps maximize their impact, nurture engagement, and navigate Alan's values to develop their full potential.<strong> </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover" href="https://alan.com/en/blog/discover-alan/a/alan-culture-excellence-through-coaching"><strong>Learn more about our coaching culture</strong></a><strong>.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Parental leave</strong>. Extended parental leave for all new parents, <em>for permanent contracts only.</em></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Important note: we hire people, not roles.</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you're excited about this opportunity but don't check every box, <strong>we'd love to hear from you.</strong> Everyone, no matter how underrepresented, should feel free to apply as it can only bring learnings or success.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>If you identify yourself as a woman</strong>: Did you know that research shows women often apply only when meeting 100% of requirements?</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Remember, this is just a guide, not a checklist.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We'll be thrilled to receive your application!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🔖 Check out our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/about">About Alan</a> and <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/careers">Career</a> pages, as well as our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://medium.com/alan">Medium</a>, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://blog.alan.com/">blog</a> and <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-Alan-EI_IE1696043.11,15.htm">Glassdoor page</a> for more info.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/alan/pre-sales-sales-engineer-paris-france-310728","tags":["Sales 🇫🇷"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris, France","created_at":1792269616},{"slug":"product-builder-mo-ai-health-companion-paris-france-413430","company_name":"Alan","title":"Product Builder - Mo (AI health companion)","description":"<h1><strong>🤖 Who we are</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We’re building Mo — a health companion for everyone.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re a small team within Alan, on a mission to redefine the future of care by <strong>democratizing access to medical expertise</strong>. We are building <strong>Mo,</strong> an intelligent, empathetic, multimodal <strong>LLM-based conversational AI assistant able</strong> to <strong>prescribe, triage, and proactively follow up</strong> on care.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Imagine giving every person in the world <strong>instant, 24/7 access to personalised medical expertise</strong> - through chat, voice, or video. That’s what we are building 🤖.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We kicked off the project in 2023, and we have launched Mo to all our french members (1M) in Q1 2026, making it the first safe AI health companion live at scale in Europe.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h1><strong>🚀 Why we need you</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mo’s scope is expanding fast: inside Alan (a new Clinic, new capabilities), across the countries we operate in, and at the interfaces with many other Alan experiences. To get this expansion right, and to keep ownership distributed within the team, we’re looking for a Product Builder to take on a real share of that complexity and ambiguity.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll own end-to-end one slice of Mo’s product scope. Depending on your profile, it could be:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🩺 <strong>Mo for reactive care.</strong> Build all the integrations between Mo, our Clinic and the healthcare system, and shape how our medical team interacts with members in and through Mo.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🛡️ <strong>Mo for insurance.</strong> Make Mo the main interface between members and Alan, building on our Support AI agents, across channels and countries.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">🌍 <strong>Mo global.</strong> Adapt Mo to new countries and find the right operating model for each (medical reviews, safety, local features).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">➕ <strong>Mo as a platform.</strong> Make Mo the companion other teams build upon, so our domain experts can ship their own experiences through it.</p></li></ul><h1> </h1><h1><strong>🎯 Is it you we’re looking for?</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for Product Builders with around 5+ years of experience who want to build state-of-the-art AI products and apply them to real-world, high-stakes problems in healthcare.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll own a product area end-to-end: problem framing, vision, prioritisation, shipping, and measuring whether we actually help members get and stay better.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll work daily with engineers, ML engineers, data, and doctors, at the frontier of LLMs and agentic systems, and see your work in production with real people.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll navigate ambiguity and many stakeholders across Alan, and turn it into clear decisions and a focused roadmap.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll be hands-on: prototyping, digging into data, reading conversations and evals, getting into the technical details with the team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll contribute to our product culture and help build the team (hiring, interview loops, etc.).</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">You would be a good fit in Mo if most of this sounds like you:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience building and shipping a live AI/LLM product</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Very hands-on, comfortable with technical and data topics (SQL, prototyping, understanding how an LLM system behaves and fails)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interest or experience in one or several medical or prevention themes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Product-minded and outcome-driven: you care about impact, not output</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Self-directed, pragmatic, driven, hard working</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Humble and still willing to grow (no matter your seniority!)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborative, enthusiastic about teamwork, learning, and teaching</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluent in English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ex-engineers and ex-founders are typically a great fit in our team</strong></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">But above all, we are looking for high potential and curiosity: make sure to show us this when you apply! Everything else is a bonus</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h1><strong>🤘 How we do it ?</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>We benefit from Alan’s platform</strong>, infrastructure, distribution, and health expertise — <strong>but</strong> <strong>operate with the speed and focus of a startup.</strong> If you’re curious about Alan’s broader vision, our<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover" href="https://www.notion.so/alaninsurance"><u> </u></a><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover" href="https://alan.com/en/blog/discover-alan/a/alan-2025-q3-letter-to-shareholders"><u>Shareholder Letters</u></a> are worth a read.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">People joining Alan are often surprised and delighted by our innovative working method. We have a set of <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/about/company-culture">cultural values</a> that guide our approach to work, such as:</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>How we work: our Leadership Principles</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Mission is the Boss</strong> — We think long-term and are methodical optimists who take risks, seeking our mission's success above all else.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Distributed Ownership</strong> — Accountable enlightened despots: everyone owns their decisions and results.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Radical Transparency</strong> — All information is accessible and written-first, so everyone can make the best decisions asynchronously.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Always Growing</strong> — Direct, positive, and caring feedback, combined with self-growth ownership.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h1>🙌   <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers/a/salary-equity">Perks &amp; Benefits</a></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Alan, we believe that <strong>being in good health is a basic need,</strong> and it starts with our employees. This is why Alaners are provided with a stimulating environment and perks ensuring they are <strong>happy, efficient and spend only high-quality time</strong> with co-workers. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Therefore, we offer:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fair rewards</strong>. Generous equity packages complement your base salary.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Flexible Office</strong>. Amazing office space at our HQ, sponsored co-working hubs or a full-remote experience with home office equipment sponsorship, we want you to live where you’re the happiest.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>All the tools you need</strong>. Top of the range equipment: Macbook Pro, keyboard, laptop stand, monitor, and noise-canceling headphones.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Flexible vacation policy and flexible working hours</strong>. Organize your  time as you  wish.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Delightful healthcare insurance:</strong> Extremely comprehensive health insurance - 100% for you and your children, 90-100% for partners depending on your country<em> (permanent contracts only)</em>.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Transport</strong>. Country-specific commuter benefits.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Learning &amp; Training opportunities.</strong> A highly  flexible Training policy free books and budget to attend and speak at conferences if the opportunity arises.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Personal growth through coaching</strong>: At Alan, coaching isn't just a perk -<strong> </strong>it's core to who we are. Every Alaner is paired with a dedicated coach from day one, who helps maximize their impact, nurture 