5em"></p><h2><strong>Main missions include:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Market intelligence:</strong> You’ll build expertise on our market and competitive landscape. You’ll work both on the quantitative side (sizing) and the qualitative side (customers’ pain points and needs).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Value proposition and pricing</strong>: Our goal is to differentiate our offer from the market. You’ll relentlessly ask yourself: what is the best product offering to become leader in this segment?</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Go-to-Market strategy: </strong>You’ll work both on renewal (account management) and expansion strategy (business development). This will require you to adapt and innovate when it comes to distribution<strong> </strong>channels, sub-segments, and partners management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>P&amp;L ownership &amp; Resources allocation: </strong>You’ll own the return on investment of your segment and are in charge of building the case for internal resources allocation based on your P&amp;L.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Product trade-off: </strong>You’ll work together with product teams in order for us to build the best product based on market insights.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>We are currently hiring for new segments:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">It gathers several, high potential sub-segments where everything is to be built.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We will focus heavily on those new opportunities in the coming years.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>⭐️ If you have some of the following, you may be a great fit ⭐️</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">At least <strong>8 years of prior experience leading a business</strong> (product category, business segment, et