s, basic data modeling), not just read them.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have proven experience with<strong> low-code tools and integrations</strong> (e.g. Clay, Make, Zapier, or equivalent) to build scalable workflows</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have <strong>configured Salesforce yourself</strong> (objects, fields, flows) and can say what you personally built vs. what an integrator or another team did.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are able to build and maintain pipelines that produce <strong>actionable insights, with clear business impact</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have excellent verbal and written communication skills;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Have at least an advanced level in <strong>English</strong>.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Are based in (or willing to relocate to) <strong>Paris, Bordeaux, Marseille, Lyon, Annecy, Nantes, Biarritz, Madrid or Barcelona.</strong></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For this role we are looking to hire within the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers/a/salary-equity">C1-E level range</a>. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Everything else is a plus. We care about having a diversity of experiences, profiles and backgrounds in our team.</h2><h2><br />🙌   <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/about/life-at-alan/a/perks">Perks &amp; Benefits</a></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Alan, we believe that <strong>being in good health is a basic need</strong>, and it starts with our employees. This is why Alaners are provided with a stimulating environment and perks ensuring they are <strong>happy, efficient and spend only high-quality time</strong> with co-workers.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Therefore, we offer:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Fair rewards</strong>