terest for <strong>getting close to other teams, </strong>to understand<strong> </strong>the<strong> operational details </strong>of their work<strong> and support them</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Business</strong> (Sales, Operations, Insurance)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Data </strong>(support in defining metrics to build &amp; monitor)</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in <strong>working with C-Levels</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Being <strong>hands on</strong>: with our distributed ownership culture, you will drive projects <strong>end-to-end</strong>, from framing to building/implementing the tools, and communication</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Thrive in exciting, high-intensity environment</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in Scale-up, SaaS, Insurance companies</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">SQL fluency</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Accounting knowledge</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">For this role we are looking to hire within the <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers/a/salary-equity">C0-C1 level range</a>. </p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>🌍 How we work</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Location:</strong> You must be legally eligible to work from France</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Remote work:</strong> We offer remote work flexibility, but the position remains Paris-based </p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"> </div><h2><strong>🎯 Important note: we hire people, not roles.</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you're excited about this opportunity but don't check every box, we'