</li>

<p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p>
<p>The ideal candidate is a proactive, commercially minded sales professional with proven B2B SaaS closing experience and the confidence to engage senior decision-makers. You should combine strong discovery and qualification skills with a willingness to prospect independently, manage complex sales conversations, and deliver measurable results in a fast-paced, remote environment.</p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p>At least 1 year of experience closing B2B SaaS deals as an Account Executive, with a demonstrated track record of meeting or exceeding sales quotas.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Ability to substantiate sales performance with clear metrics, including quota attainment and closed-won results.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Native-level Swiss German proficiency and business-fluent English for the Swiss German-speaking profile; alternatively, fluency in both German and French for the German- and French-speaking profile.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Strong discovery, qualification, and consultative selling skills, with experience using methodologies such as MEDDICC.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Confidence and persistence in outbound sales, including cold calling, personalized prospecting, and engaging busy founders and senior stakeholders.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Ability to uncover customer needs, communicate business value, address objections, and navigate complex decision-making processes.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Strong negotiation and closing skills, with a proactive approach to maintaining deal momentum and achieving sales targets.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Familiarity with AI-powered tools and the ability to integrate them into daily sales workflows.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Experience using HubSpot or a comparable CRM, with strong organizational skills and consistent data hygiene.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Coachability, adaptability, and a willingness to seek feedback and implement improvements quickly.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Excellent communication, relationship-building, and time-management skills in a distributed working environment.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>An existing professional network among Swiss founders or HR leaders is an advantage.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Previous experience in HR technology, payroll, Employer of Record (EOR), or other compliance-intensive solutions is a plus.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Additional French language skills are beneficial for engaging customers in French-speaking Switzerland.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Creativity and resourcefulness in identifying new ways to reach decision-makers and generate qualified opportunities.</p>
</li>

<p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li>
<p>Competitive compensation starting from €50,000 gross annual on-target earnings (OTE), comprising 60% base salary and 40% variable bonus, depending on location, skills, and experience.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Fully remote working arrangement within approximately two hours of Central European Time (CET).</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>WorkFlex program offering flexibility to work from different locations, subject to applicable policies.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Dedicated Well-Being Day to rest, recharge, and support personal well-being.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Subsidized gym memberships to support physical health and an active lifestyle.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Training and Development Allowance to support continuous learning and professional growth.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Annual team meetups to build relationships and strengthen collaboration across the distributed team.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Opportunity to work with an international sales organization spanning Europe, Africa, and the Middle East.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Collaborative, performance-oriented culture that encourages knowledge-sharing, constructive feedback, and collective success.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Commitment to diversity, inclusion, and equal employment opportunities.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Benefits may vary depending on the employee's location and applicable local regulations.</p>
</li>

