000000">You have deep expertise in JavaScript and TypeScript, with hands-on experience in Angular.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have a proven track record designing and running cloud-native systems on at least one major cloud platform (GCP preferred), alongside a solid understanding of Kubernetes container orchestration.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You are experienced in building and maintaining CI/CD pipelines, applying DevOps/GitOps principles, and using Infrastructure-as-Code tooling like Terraform.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have demonstrated the ability to lead technical projects end-to-end and possess excellent communication skills to translate complex technical concepts for non-technical stakeholders.</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">You have familiarity with event-driven architectures (Kafka, NATS), GraphQL API design and security engineering best practices (OWASP, SOC 2).</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">What We Offer</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Competitive salary and equity/options package</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">25 vacation days + 12 balance days per year</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Travel allowance</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Attractive pension plan</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Modern workplace in Rotterdam (well-located)</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Training and development opportunities</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Dutch lesson package</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Work in an innovative company in fintech / payment technology</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url